  "title": "· New Bags | Hermès Presents Spring/Summer 2027 Womenswear Show: Shapes of Air ·",
  "original_title": "新包 | Hermès 发布2027春夏女装秀：空气之形",
  "excerpt": "Hermès’ Spring/Summer 2027 show in Paris featured Nadège Vanhée’s “The Shape of Air” theme with lightweight knits, leather mesh, and adjustable zippers for fluid, sculptural movement.",
