    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Hermès Spring/Summer 2027 women's show has just wrapped at the Garde Républicaine headquarters in Paris. This season's theme, \"The Shape of Air,\" sees women's artistic director Nadège Vanhée working with featherweight openwork knits, leather mesh, silk crepe, and ultra-fine calfskin to create a sense of airy movement. Adjustable zippers on trench coats, skirts, and trousers allow the silhouette to be reshaped at will, lending the clothes sculptural drape and a fluid, effortless dynamism.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
