    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· Bucket Bags ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The new Mangeoire bucket bag reaches back to a 1949 archival design, its bucket silhouette inspired by a horse feed bag and carrying on the house's equestrian DNA. This season's standout detail is a scattering of irregular circular cutouts across the body, giving the bag a sense of breathing room and nodding cleverly to the \"Shape of Air\" theme. The original twisted-rope handle has been replaced with metal, for a bold, sculptural look.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
