    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Sac à dos Toron backpack brings a fishing-net motif into the mix, pairing breathable mesh with soft calfskin trim to trace a silhouette that feels light yet dimensional. Instead of wrapping the body in leather, the leather is cleverly used as structure to support the shape, giving the craftsmanship a relaxed, vacation-ready ease.",
