    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Militaire bucket bag arrives in a compact size, with an H canvas body, Hunter calfskin trim, and a discreet Clou de Selle stud as the finishing touch. The Petit Bel-il also takes on canvas, its leather drawstring paired with a signature clasp for a clever closure—a gender-neutral design that captures an elegant sporty spirit.",
