    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· Bridlelock ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The new Bridlelock bag calls to mind the Toolbox from 2010, itself inspired by a vintage toolbox. It features a milk-carton-style top opening with a palladium-finish square metal clasp, while a tubular handle and long strap attach to the sides via D-rings, allowing it to be carried by hand, over the shoulder, or crossbody. It comes in a range of colors including earth tones, elephant gray, bright white, and black.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
