      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Rênes bag shapes a minimalist trapezoid in soft calfskin, its triangular side cuts and magnetic top frame giving it an architectural, structured stance. Leather tabs at either side add a lively detail—a gentle pull on the ties opens the bag, lending the clean design an offhand ease.",
