      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Ring Bag, born in the 1950s, returns as a neat belt bag, keeping its envelope flap and signature ring clasp. Crafted in smooth Box calfskin, its crisp lines project a polished, no-nonsense attitude.",
