      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "A new shoulder bag builds a compact, lightweight cylindrical shape in Swift calfskin, its top zip finished with the signature H padlock detail. The Saut bag pairs an open-top hobo silhouette with a Cadena padlock, striking a vintage yet elegant note.",
