      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Kelly Hobo carries on the design language of the So-Kelly, shaping a clean, fluid bucket silhouette in Chéri calfskin with the signature Touret turn-lock as its focal point. Seams on either side of the clasp extend into an adjustable shoulder strap. This season brings new colorways including bright white, sesame, and dark brown.",
