    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· And More ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Garden Party Voyage comes in \"Orange Sunset\" H canvas with tonal leather trim, its vivid hue bringing energy to spring and summer looks. The Petit Sac mini bag is a study in symmetry, shaping a slender, fluid crescent in Box calfskin, with H-shaped metal clasps cleverly integrated at either side of the D-ring handle so it can be carried by hand or on the arm—a light design with a breezy, easygoing air. The Étrivière Shopping tote makes its asymmetric strap the headline detail, inspired by the equestrian girth used to secure a saddle; an adjustable buckle lets it be carried by hand or on the shoulder.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
